---

<BaseLayout
  title="便宜机场推荐 - 10 大极致性价比与高流量套餐品牌榜单"
  description="筛选全网高性价比、便宜好用、量大管饱的平价网络服务机场，涵盖Sogo云、唯兔云、飞V、灵猫、浪网、隐形人、快狸、二猫云、梯子云与速界。"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 space-y-12">
    <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbItems} />

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-dark-border/80 pb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 bg-amber-600/15 border border-amber-500/25 px-3 py-1 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wider">
        HIGH COST-PERFORMANCE & VALUE
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        便宜性价比机场推荐
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        花最少的钱，享优质的网！专为预算有限、追求高性价比与大流量套餐的用户量身定制。
      </p>

      <!-- Quick Navigation Buttons -->
      <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="/ranking"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 hover:border-indigo-500/60 hover:bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 hover:text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
          </svg>
          <span>查看机场排行榜</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/stable"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 hover:border-emerald-500/60 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 hover:text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all shadow-sm"
        >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
          <span>前往稳定机场专区</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Highlights -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
          低至月付
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">超低入门门槛</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          提供灵活动态月付方案，试错成本低，随时根据体验自由更换。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
          TB+
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">超大流量包</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          套餐包含丰厚流量额度，轻松满足日常多设备、多团队日常查阅需求。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-card border border-dark-border space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
          多节点
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">常用节点覆盖全</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          涵盖港、日、韩、美、新等主流地区节点，兼顾基本流媒体解锁。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 10 Cheap Brands Ranking Cards Grid -->
    <section class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-4 py-1">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">
          10 大平价高性价比机场推荐与规格卡片
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">
          结构化展示线路协议、支持支付、节点覆盖、解锁服务、参考套餐与官方查询入口
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        {cheapBrands.map((brand) => (
          <RankingCard
            rank={brand.rank}
            name={brand.name}
            slug={brand.slug}
            badge={brand.badge}
            rating={brand.rating}
            slogan={brand.slogan}
            startPrice={brand.startPrice}
            protocols={brand.protocols}
            locations={brand.locations}
            unlocks={brand.unlocks}
            paymentMethods={brand.paymentMethods}
            whyChoose={brand.whyChoose}
            packages={brand.packages}
            queryUrl={brand.queryUrl}
            detailUrl={brand.detailUrl}
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <FAQ items={cheapFaqs} title="便宜机场解答" />

    <CTASection
      title="想了解综合排行全貌？"
      subtitle="访问 2026 最新机场排行榜，掌握更多主流服务商的客观评测数据。"
      buttonText="查看完整排行榜"
      buttonHref="/ranking"
    />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
